  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe issue https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10677 proposed extending `TextMetrics` for Canvas text editing and styling. But using `TextMetrics` will make the solution not extensible for multi-styled text. \n\nThe solution relies on measuring the text using whatever style is currently selected then calling `getTextClusters()`. Clients have no opportunity to intervene before shaping to achieve, for example, custom rendering.\n\nExtending `CanvasText` to do text analysis and shaping will allow multi-styled text to be processed.",
